[29.012975, "o", "\u001b[8;6H\u001b[38;5;153m\u001b[1me\u001b[9;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246mmemex-\u001b[39m\u001b[1mcle\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246manup\u001b[9;33HInspect and triage Memex\u001b[Cvault\u001b[C\u001b[39m\u001b[1mcle\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246manu\u001b[C \u001b[Candidates: duplicate, empty, stale, o\u001b[C orphaned note\u001b[C and broken links. Use for \"clean up my vault\", \"wh\u001b[9;179H needs tidying\", \"볼트 정리\", \"중복 노트 정리\", \"낡은 노트 정리\", or\u001b[10;33H\"깨진 링크\u001b[C고쳐줘\"; every mutation requires \u001b[Cxplicit user direction and a preview. (user)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[11;4H\u001b[38;5;246mmemex-review    \u001b[11;33HReview pending\u001b[Cs\u001b[Cared\u001b[Ccaptures under the Memex\u001b[Cagent inbox\u001b[Cand decid\u001b[C wh\u001b[Cther\u001b[Cto promote, defer, p\u001b[11;133Hvatize, or archiv\u001b[C them. Use for \"agent inbox 검토해줘\", \"처리 안\u001b[C한 seco\u001b[Cd-brain 후보 보여줘\",\u001b[C\"review my pending\u001b[12;33HM\u001b[Cmex captures\", or \"promote\u001b[Cthis inb\u001b[Cx it\u001b[Cm\". m\u001b[Cm\u001b[Cx-save\u001b[Cis what stages\u001b[12;109Hs\u001b[C ca\u001b[Cd\u001b[Cdates; do not use this for structural vault \u001b[39m\u001b[1mcle\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246manup (memex-cleanup), today's daily reflection (memex-daily), or the user's captur…\u001b[14;7H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
