[37.281475, "o", "\u001b[30;5H\u001b[38;5;153m\u001b[1ml\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;153mear\u001b[30;33HStart a new \u001b[Cession with empty context; previous session stays on disk (resumable with /resume)\u001b[31;5H\u001b[39m\u001b[1ml\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246maude-api\u001b[31;33HReference for\u001b[Cthe \u001b[39m\u001b[1mCl\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246maude API /\u001b[CAnthr\u001b[Cpic\u001b[CSDK\u001b[C- model\u001b[Cids, pricing, params, streaming, tool use, MCP, agents, caching, token counting, model migration. TRIGGER - read BEFORE opening the target file; don't skip\u001b[32;3H\u001b[39m                              \u001b[38;5;246mbecause\u001b[Cit \"looks like a\u001b[Cone-liner\" - when\u001b[32;77Her: th\u001b[C pr\u001b[Cmpt names \u001b[39m\u001b[1mCl\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246maude/Anthropic\u001b[Cin any for\u001b[C (Claude, Anthropic, Fable, Opus, Sonnet, Haiku, `anthropic`, `@anthropic-ai`, `claude-*`, `us.anthropic.*`, `[1m]`); th…\u001b[33;5H\u001b[39m\u001b[1ml\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246maude-in-chrome\u001b[33;33HAu\u001b[Comates your\u001b[CCh\u001b[Come b\u001b[Cowser to interact with web pages - \u001b[39m\u001b[1mcl\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246micking elements, filling forms, capturing screenshots, reading console logs, and navigating sites. Opens pages in new tabs within your existing Chrome\u001b[34;3H\u001b[39m                              \u001b[38;5;246msession. R\u001b[Cquires site-level permissions before executing (configured in the extension).\u001b[36;6H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
