[37.960835, "o", "\u001b[19;1H \u001b[C통과합니다. 결과는 팀원 C(state-shar\u001b[C-bug-hunter)에게 SendM\u001b[19;64Hs\u001b[Cge로 보고했습니다. 현재 파일 기준 3개 테스트 모두 통과 중이라 다른 팀원 작업도 이미 반영된\u001b[20;3H것으로 보입니다.\r\n                                                                                \r\n\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[CCooked for 33s · done 10:30 AM\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C               \u001b[C      \u001b[C           \u001b[C      \u001b[C          \u001b[C    \u001b[C    \u001b[C    \u001b[C                       \u001b[C  \u001b[C    \u001b[C         \u001b[C          \u001b[C      \u001b[C          \u001b[C     \u001b[C        \r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @state-share-bug-hunt…\u001b[3m: 확인했습니다. abs(a-b) <= tolerance 로의 수정과 원인 분석(부동소수점 표현 오차, tolerance 파라미터 미사용) 모두 타당합…\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[27;1H\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[C\u001b[39mTeammate C confirmed the fix and\u001b[Cmarked\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cteam's\u001b[Cwork\u001b[Ccomplete\u001b[C-\u001b[Call\u001b[C3\u001b[Ctests\u001b[Cpass.\u001b[29;1H\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[CChurned for 1s · done 10:30 AM\u001b[29;159H\u001b[39m\u001b[48;5;235m \u001b[1mcontent/concepts/what-is-agent-teams.md\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;5;235m                                                  \u001b[30;3H\u001b[49m                                                                                                                             \u001b[30;159H\u001b[48;5;235m \u001b[38;5;246m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m \u001b[31;1H\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m❯ \u001b[38;5;231m/clear\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[48;5;235m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m  4 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;235m \u001b[39m                                                                                    \u001b[32;33H\u001b[49m  