[46.879658, "o", "\u001b[42;160H\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[1m5\u001b[42;176H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;72m\u001b[48;5;235m+31\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;174m-31\u001b[44;160H\u001b[38;5;246mcontent/concepts/what-is-agent-teams.md\u001b[44;241H\u001b[38;5;72m+22\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;174m-25\u001b[45;160H\u001b[38;5;246mexamples/agent-teams-practice/agent-team-demo.cast\u001b[46;160Hexamples/agent-teams-practice/buggy_app/calc.py\u001b[46;243H\u001b[38;5;72m+5\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;174m-3\u001b[47;160H\u001b[38;5;246mFINALIZED.md\u001b[47;243H\u001b[38;5;72m+1\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;174m-1\u001b[48;160H\u001b[38;5;246mtools/mkdocs_hooks.py\u001b[48;243H\u001b[38;5;72m+3\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;174m-2\u001b[50;160H\u001b[38;5;246m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[51;160H\u001b[39m\u001b[1mcontent/concepts/what-is-agent-teams.md\u001b[52;160H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[48;5;235m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[53;160H\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m  4 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;235m \u001b[54;160H\u001b[2m  5 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;235m 한 세션이 **팀 리더**를 맡아 작업을 나누고 결과를 종합하며, 나머지 **팀원**들은 각\u001b[57;3H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[47.52022, "o", "\u001b[42;1H \u001b[C      \u001b[C                \u001b[C    \u001b[C   \u001b[C                          \u001b[C   \u001b[C     \u001b[C  \u001b[C   \u001b[C       \u001b[C      \u001b[C     \u001b[C \u001b[C       \u001b[C  \u001b[C                              \u001b[C   \u001b[C \u001b[C     \u001b[C  \r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[C\u001b[39m\u001b[1mFixed:\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;153mmoving_average\u001b[39m's loop was\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mrange(len(nums) - win\u001b[Cow)\u001b[39m, one\u001b[Cshort of the correct window count\u001b[C- changed to\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mrange(len(nums) - window + 1)\u001b[39m. All\u001b[C3\u001b[Ctests\u001b[Cin\u001b[44;3H\u001b[38;5;153mtest_calc.py\u001b[39m now pass (the\u001b[Cother\u001b[Ctwo\u001b[Cteammates\u001b[Cfixed\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153madd_record\u001b[C\u001b[39mand\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mis_close_enough\u001b[C\u001b[39min\u001b[Cparallel).\u001b[CReported\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cfix\u001b[Cand\u001b[Crationale\u001b[Cto\u001b[Cteammate\u001b[CC\u001b[45;3H(state-share-bug-hunter).\r\n \u001b[C                                 \r\n\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[CCogitated for 29s · done 10:30 AM\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                         \r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from\u001b[C@state-share-bug-hunt…\u001b[3m: 확인했습니다. range(len(nums)-window) → range(len(nums)-window+1) 근거(슬라이딩 시작 인덱스가 0..len(nums)-window \u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[51;3H\u001b[38;5;153m/doc-polish                   content/ 안 문서를 교정·윤문·개선하는 전 과정을 조율한다. 스냅샷을 뜨고, 계량하고, style-guardian 에게 검수를 시키고, copy-editor 에게 적용시키고, guard.py 로 보호 구간을 검증한 뒤 결과를 기록한다. \"문서 윤문해줘\",\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n \u001b[C   \u001b[C        \u001b[C \u001b[C    \u001b[C   \u001b[C      \u001b[38;5;153m\"이 문서 다듬어줘\", \"오탈자 잡아줘\", \"어체 통일해줘\", \"교정해줘\" 같은 요청에 쓴다. 파이프라인은 건드리지 않는다. (project)\u001b[39m\u001b[52;159H\u001b[K\u001b[53;3H\u001b[38;5;246m/code-embed                   예시 코드·설정 파일(SKILL.md, YAML, 스크립트 등)을 에디터 창처럼 디자인해 content/ 문서에 접기/펼치기 위젯으로 붙인다. \"이 코드 예시 넣어줘\", \"설정 파일 펼치기로 보여줘\", \"코드블록 UI 이쁘게 만들어줘\" 같은 요청에\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n \u001b[C                              \u001b[38;5;246m쓴다. (project)\u001b[39m\u001b[54;159H\u001b[K\u001b[55;3H\u001b[38;5;246m/init                         Initialize a new CLAUDE.md file with codebase documentation\u001b[57;3H\u001b[39m/\u001b[60;45H\u001b[38;5;246m/diff to hide \u001b[39m\u001b[60;63H\u001b[K\u001b[57;4H"]
