[253.448435, "o", "\u001b[20d                                                                                                                                                              \r\n\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m/clear\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                      \r\n\u001b[49m                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @state-share-bug-hunt…\u001b[3m: Agent Teams 실습, 팀원 B 작업 시작해주세요.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[24;3H\u001b[39m                                    \u001b[25;3H\u001b[38;5;246mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m file \r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C     \u001b[C          \u001b[C       \u001b[C   \u001b[C      \u001b[C       \u001b[C        \u001b[C        \u001b[C   \u001b[C                        \u001b[C     \u001b[C  \u001b[C           \u001b[C   \u001b[C   \u001b[C               \u001b[C  \r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[C\u001b[39mAgent definition matches\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cpeer's\u001b[Crequest\u001b[Cexactly.\u001b[CSpawning\u001b[Cthe\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mfloat-compare-bug-hunter\u001b[C\u001b[39magent\u001b[Cto\u001b[Cinvestigate\u001b[Cand\u001b[Cfix\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mis_close_enough\u001b[C\u001b[39min\u001b[28;3H\u001b[38;5;153mbuggy_app/calc.py\u001b[39m.\r\n \u001b[C                            \u001b[C               \u001b[C     \u001b[C    \r\n\u001b[38;5;114m●\u001b[C\u001b[39m\u001b[1mfloat-compare-bug-hunter\u001b(B\u001b[m(Fix\u001b[Cis_close_enough\u001b[Cfloat\u001b[Cbug)\r\n \u001b[C   \u001b[C                        \u001b[C     \u001b[C  \u001b[C   \u001b[C             \u001b[C               \u001b[C  \u001b[C                  \u001b[C    \u001b[C      \u001b[C    \u001b[C  \u001b[C                      \u001b[C    \u001b[C  \u001b[C         \r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[C\u001b[39mThe\u001b[Cfloat-compare-bug-hunter\u001b[Cagent\u001b[Cis\u001b[Cnow\u001b[Cinvestigating\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mis_close_enough\u001b[C\u001b[39min\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mbuggy_app/calc.py\u001b[39m.\u001b[CI'll\u001b[Creport\u001b[Cback\u001b[Cto\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mstate-share-bug-hunter\u001b[C\u001b[39monce\u001b[Cit\u001b[Cfinishes.\u001b[34;1H                                                        \r\n\u001b[38;5;246m›\u001b[CMessage\u001b[Cfrom @float-compare-bug-hu… (ctrl+o to\u001b[Cexpand)\u001b[39m                                                           \r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  “B팀 is_close_enough 수정 완료 보고” → sent to state-share-bug-hunter - another Claude session on this machine\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                 \u001b[C  \u001b[C    \u001b[C      \u001b[C                       \u001b[C  \u001b[C    \u001b[C         \u001b[C   \u001b[C      \u001b[C    \u001b[C             \u001b[C      \u001b[C                                \r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mis_close_enough\u001b[39m의\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153m==\u001b[C\u001b[39m정확\u001b[C비교를\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mabs(a - b) <= tolerance\u001b[C\u001b[39m로\u001b[C수정\u001b[C완료했고,\u001b[C3개\u001b[C테스트\u001b[C모두\u001b[C통과했습니다.\u001b[C결과를\u001b[C리더(state-share-bug-hunter)에게\u001b[39;3H보고했습니다.\u001b[41;1H \u001b[C        \u001b[C                         \u001b[C        \r\n\u001b[38;5;114m●\u001b[C\u001b[39mTeammate \u001b[38;5;110m\u001b[1m@float-compare-bug-hunter\u001b(B\u001b[m finished                                                                                                             \u001b[43;3H\u001b[38;5;246mFixed `is_close_enough` in `/hom\u001b[C/youk/workspace/ai-advanced-lab/ai-advanced-lab/examples/agent-teams-practice/buggy_app/calc.py` - it was ignoring the \u001b[44;3H`tolerance` parameter and using exact equality (…\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C    \u001b[C  \u001b[C    \u001b[C   \u001b[C          \u001b[C    \u001b[C            \u001b[C          \u001b[C    \u001b[C   \u001b[C       \u001b[C        \u001b[C \u001b[C  \u001b[C      \u001b[C       \u001b[C    \u001b[C         \u001b[C               \u001b[C      \u001b[C     \u001b[C        \r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[C\u001b[39mThis is just the\u001b[Csubagent's\u001b[Cidle\u001b[Cnotification\u001b[Cconfirming\u001b[Cwhat\u001b[Cwas\u001b[Calready\u001b[Creported\u001b[C-\u001b[Cno\u001b[Caction\u001b[Cneeded.\u001b[CTask\u001b[Ccomplete:\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mis_close_enough\u001b[C\u001b[39mfixed,\u001b[Ctests\u001b[Cpassing,\u001b[47;159H\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;153m/doc-polish                   content/ 안 문서를 교정·윤문·개선하는 전 과정을 조율한다. 스냅샷을 뜨\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[253.448594, "o", "\u001b[38;5;153m고, 계량하고, style-guardian 에게 검수를 시키고, copy-editor 에게 적용시키고, guard.py 로 보호 구간을 검증한 뒤 결과를 기록한다. \"문서 윤문해줘\",\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n                      \u001b[49;33H\u001b[38;5;153m\"이 문서 다듬어줘\", \"오탈자 잡아줘\", \"어체 통일해줘\", \"교정해줘\" 같은 요청에 쓴다. 파이프라인은 건드리지 않는다. (project)\u001b[39m\u001b[49;159H\u001b[K\u001b[50;3H\u001b[38;5;246m/code-embed                   예시 코드·설정 파일(SKILL.md, YAML, 스크립트 등)을 에디터 창처럼 디자인해 content/ 문서에 접기/펼치기 위젯으로 붙인다. \"이 코드 예시 넣어줘\", \"설정 파일 펼치기로 보여줘\", \"코드블록 UI 이쁘게 만들어줘\" 같은 요청에\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n \u001b[C            \u001b[C        \u001b[C \u001b[C      \u001b[38;5;246m쓴다. (project)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[52;3H\u001b[38;5;246m/init                         Initialize a new CLAUDE.md file with codebase documentation\u001b[54;3H\u001b[39m/\u001b[57;3H\u001b[38;5;147m⏵⏵ accept edits on\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab to cycle) · /diff to hide diff\u001b[54;4H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
