[256.814232, "o", "\u001b[51;3H\u001b[K\n\u001b[38;5;153m/\u001b[1mex\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;153mit                         \u001b[1mEx\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;153mit the CLI\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[53;5H\u001b[1mx\u001b[53;34Hx\u001b[54;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246mmem\u001b[39m\u001b[1mex\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m-search\u001b[54;33HSearch across Mem\u001b[39m\u001b[1mex\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m notes and mail while\u001b[Cpreserving source boundaries, or trace backlinks to a note or\u001b[Cmail message. Use for sou\u001b[Cce-agnostic vault\u001b[Cse\u001b[54;184Hch, note lookup, Korean-English query expansion, \"search/find\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[55;33H\u001b[38;5;246min Mem\u001b[39m\u001b[1mex\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m\", \"노트 찾아\", \"볼트에서 검색\", \"영어로도 찾아줘\", \"역참조\",\u001b[Cor \"백링크\"\u001b[55;116HUse memex-read for the full body \u001b[Cf one selected hit, and memex-research when the answer must be synthesised across mail, Confluen…\u001b[57;6H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
