[256.890428, "o", "\u001b[51;3H\u001b[38;5;153m/\u001b[1mexi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;153mt                         \u001b[1mExi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;153mt the CLI\u001b[52;3H\u001b[38;5;246m/m\u001b[39m\u001b[1me\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246mme\u001b[39m\u001b[1mx\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m-d\u001b[39m\u001b[1mi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246mstill                Consolidate several \u001b[39m\u001b[1mexi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246msting Memex notes into one durable derived note with source links. Use for \"distill my notes\", \"extract the decisions\", \"consolidate these notes\", \"핵심만 추려서 노트로\", \"여러 노트 요약\", or\u001b[53;3H\u001b[39m                              \u001b[38;5;246m\"사실만 추려줘\". Savi\u001b[Cg a single conversation output instead is memex-file, refreshing one \u001b[39m\u001b[1mexi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246msting distillate is memex-edit, and retiring a stale one is memex-cleanup. (user)\u001b[54;5H\u001b[39m\u001b[1me\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246me\u001b[54;10Hed\u001b[39m\u001b[1mi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246mt  \u001b[54;33HCh\u001b[Cnge\u001b[54;41Hn \u001b[39m\u001b[1mexi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246msting Memex note\u001b[Cin place -\u001b[Con\u001b[C heading section, one frontmat\u001b[Cer key, or a full-body rew\u001b[Cite -\u001b[Cunder a revisi\u001b[Cn\u001b[Cgua\u001b[Cd so a con\u001b[Curren\u001b[54;180Hedit is\u001b[54;189Hev\u001b[Cr clobbered. Use for \"edit/update/rewrite this note\",\u001b[55;33H\"fix a typo\u001b[C, \"이 섹션만 고쳐줘\",\u001b[C\"노트 수정해줘\",\u001b[C\"노트 고쳐줘\", or \"메모 업데이트\". Th\u001b[C note must already \u001b[39m\u001b[1mexi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246mst: creating on\u001b[C is memex-file (agent output) or mem\u001b[Cx-app\u001b[Cnd (user-dictat\u001b[Cd capture). (user)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[57;7H"]
